cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "ges-uves-mk-audit: masked-line ablation audit of a LightGBM F/G/K temperature-class classifier for Gaia-ESO UVES spectra (code, trained model and feature matrix)"
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software archive and the accompanying paper."
type: software
version: "1.2.1"
