    affiliation: "Department of Computer Science, Lakehead University, 5 Ross Street, Barrie, ON L4M 3A5, Canada"
abstract: "Code, trained LightGBM model, feature matrix and analysis artifacts for a methods note on masked-line ablation of a three-class (F/G/K) effective-temperature-bin classifier of Gaia-ESO FLAMES-UVES U580 spectra: which dependencies survive a controlled ablation, the luminosity-class composition of the classes, and a train-test scale mismatch that explains the collapse under polynomial re-normalisation."
